            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# DisplayPilot for macOS

This release adds built-in update notifications and a manual “Check for Updates…” command. Automatic installation stays opt-in. It also improves the visibility and spacing of app icons in workspace layout choices.

此版本加入内置更新提醒和“检查更新…”命令；自动安装仍由用户自行选择。同时优化了工作集布局选项中 App 图标的辨识度与间距。
]]></description>
